<title>UK: BFG HYPO SETS 200 MLN MARK FOUR-YEAR BOND.</title>
<headline>BFG HYPO SETS 200 MLN MARK FOUR-YEAR BOND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BFG HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    15.AUG.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.07    PAY DATE    15.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	MGT/UND    0.5	 SELL CONC  1.25</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
</text>
